       },
       "Title": "Look-At",
       "Description": "Look At IK on the head bone turns a chain toward a target (here: you). Chain length picks how many bones share the turn, Root Share how much the lowest takes, Max Bone Angle limits each bone, and the look fades out when the target passes Max Turn Angle behind the character. Walk around them.",
       "Radius": 6.0,
       "Focus": {
        "flags": 2,
