       },
       "Title": "Hand IK (Two Bone)",
       "Description": "Two Bone IK puts a hand on a target and bends the elbow toward a pole. Pull the lever (E at the marker): your pick-up clip carries a 'HandIK' curve that is the IK weight, so the hand lands on the grip exactly while the clip reaches. The driver's hands ride a turning wheel; the third reaches for an orb, eased by soften.",
